00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:51.000
Whitney Hodges: to people who are searching for the most relevant terms. But they're also, Google is going to show these ads to the users who have the highest likelihood of actually clicking on the ad, right? Google wants to make sure that the results that it's showing its users are relevant and are helpful to them. That's what keeps people coming back to Google and utilizing the platform.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:08:00.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, with the Google Ads, they are pay-per-click, so you are only being charged ad spend on Google if someone is actually clicking on your ad.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.000
