00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.000
judy: Hmm.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:26.000
Whitney Hodges: the headlines, um, and any other sort of, like, phrases or paragraphs that are going to be pulled in there. Yeah.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.000
