00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:55.000
Whitney Hodges: really regardless of whether people click or not. You're kind of paying for that… that visibility, right? Um, now, of course, the goal is going to be to… to get people to click, and to get them over to the landing page, and to, um, inquire, right? Um, but it's just the billing works a little differently than, you know.

