judy: Mm-hmm.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:51.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, in the, in the newsfeed. And also on the Meta ad side is where we can get a little bit more focused with the targeting, so interest-based targeting of really making sure ads are only being shown to, um, you know, your, your ideal client, right? People that we know are engaged.

