00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:28.000
Whitney Hodges: So why we love Google and Meta ads so much and why they are so effective is, you know, on the Google ad side, unlike SEO, it's not like, you know, putting all of this work into your website and then kind of waiting around, you know, for months, right, just to see what happens.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.000
judy: Right.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:49.000
Whitney Hodges: and how that changes things in the search results. It's pretty much immediate, you know. Once we launch your Google ads campaign, you are going to start showing up in the search results for users with your, you know, sponsored Google ads. You should start seeing more traffic because people are going to be, you know, clicking and getting over to the website through the ads.

